  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组添加了一些来自<strong><em>《Apex英雄》</em></strong>的更多枪械。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>R-301卡宾枪</strong></span></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://imgpp.com/image/301.Cc0f8\" alt=\"\"></em></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wTbmDFZk/301.png\" width=\"716\" height=\"300\"></em></strong></span></p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>30-30连发枪</strong></span></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PrqDL03x/3030.png\" width=\"761\" height=\"214\"></em></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>M600喷火枪</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/ZRsCS58h/spirefire.png\" width=\"815\" height=\"328\"></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>克雷贝尔</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J0XzJckp/kr.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"342\"><br><br></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mr. Crayfish的枪械模组</a>才能工作。<br>1.20.1版本需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish的枪械模组[非官方版]</a>才能工作。<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有枪械配方都可以在配置文件中修改。（1.12.2之后，您需要打开jar包进行修改）<br><br></span></pre>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
